        "body": "**What this PR does / why we need it**:\nThe scaffolded `values.yaml` from `helm create` sets the default HTTPRoute path match to `/headers`, which is an odd path for a fresh chart. This changes it to `/healthz` so the generated route matches a conventional endpoint.\n\n**Special notes for your reviewer**:\nOnly the default value in the scaffold template changes.\n\n**If applicable**:\n- [x] this PR contains user facing changes (the `docs needed` label should be applied if so)\n- [ ] this PR contains unit tests\n- [ ] this PR has been tested for backwards compatibility\n",
